<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Belgo Mineira raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Belgo Mineira raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robert Fleming analyst Rafael Biderman said he had raised his rating on Brazilian steel maker Companhia Siderurgica Belgo Mineira to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Belgo Mineira is already a company that is undervalued relative to its size,&quot; Biderman wrote in a January 24 report.</p>
<p>-- &quot;If the acquisition of Mendes Junior SA proves to be a success, the capacity could increase to 1.90 million tons and Belgo would be a big driver of consolidation in the non-flat steel sector.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's shares rose 2.97 reais to 91 in Sao Paulo Monday.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
